{"1431750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Henchmen", "steam_appid": 1431750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4247200], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/2691e3720c9b867411b5c96f6a557ff2.poster.avif?t=1779785236\" width=504 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/2691e3720c9b867411b5c96f6a557ff2.webm?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/2691e3720c9b867411b5c96f6a557ff2.mp4?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to New Queens… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…where fists fly, bullets rain and crime pays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking place across the snow-covered Winter of 1990 and the sun-bleached streets of Summer ‘96, The Henchmen chronicles your career criminal’s rise through the ranks. Starting off as a low-level street thug and culminating in a clash of the crime lords, New Queens is yours to reign in blood - or leave in a body bag. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining 90’s nostalgia with modern design principles, The Henchmen shakes up the classic open world formula with combo-driven combat, arcade driving physics and full co-op support; delivering a pulse pounding, power-sliding, partner-ready take on the crime sandbox. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re behind the barrel of your gun or the wheel of a hot new ride, you’re about to show this city what it takes to own the underworld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/5fd0a23a0b42b9990cb118fb117dbac7.poster.avif?t=1779785236\" width=504 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/5fd0a23a0b42b9990cb118fb117dbac7.webm?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/5fd0a23a0b42b9990cb118fb117dbac7.mp4?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two player co-op, with both split-screen and shared screen support,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-based combat system that trades combos, dodges and deft manoeuvres for health and ammo rewards.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense cop car chases (dedicated powerslide button included!),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenges and hidden collectibles - unlocking faster rides, more explosive weaponry and game-changing new equipment.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thumping 90’s Techno soundtrack - plus hidden audio tapes containing your favourite tracks from DOSMan games!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable graphics options. Mix and match graphical effects from the hardware-accelerated PCs of the 90s, to the polygonal purity of the PSX. Your memories are yours to replicate!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something old, something new. Mixing retro sensibilities with modern-day QoL features, The Henchmen cherishes your retro gaming memories while injecting a fresh new spin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/2691e3720c9b867411b5c96f6a557ff2.poster.avif?t=1779785236\" width=504 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/2691e3720c9b867411b5c96f6a557ff2.webm?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/2691e3720c9b867411b5c96f6a557ff2.mp4?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to New Queens… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…where fists fly, bullets rain and crime pays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking place across the snow-covered Winter of 1990 and the sun-bleached streets of Summer ‘96, The Henchmen chronicles your career criminal’s rise through the ranks. Starting off as a low-level street thug and culminating in a clash of the crime lords, New Queens is yours to reign in blood - or leave in a body bag. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining 90’s nostalgia with modern design principles, The Henchmen shakes up the classic open world formula with combo-driven combat, arcade driving physics and full co-op support; delivering a pulse pounding, power-sliding, partner-ready take on the crime sandbox. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re behind the barrel of your gun or the wheel of a hot new ride, you’re about to show this city what it takes to own the underworld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/5fd0a23a0b42b9990cb118fb117dbac7.poster.avif?t=1779785236\" width=504 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/5fd0a23a0b42b9990cb118fb117dbac7.webm?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/extras/5fd0a23a0b42b9990cb118fb117dbac7.mp4?t=1779785236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two player co-op, with both split-screen and shared screen support,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-based combat system that trades combos, dodges and deft manoeuvres for health and ammo rewards.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense cop car chases (dedicated powerslide button included!),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenges and hidden collectibles - unlocking faster rides, more explosive weaponry and game-changing new equipment.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thumping 90’s Techno soundtrack - plus hidden audio tapes containing your favourite tracks from DOSMan games!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable graphics options. Mix and match graphical effects from the hardware-accelerated PCs of the 90s, to the polygonal purity of the PSX. Your memories are yours to replicate!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something old, something new. Mixing retro sensibilities with modern-day QoL features, The Henchmen cherishes your retro gaming memories while injecting a fresh new spin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Relive the ‘90s crime sandbox alone, or with a partner by your side. Prepare for a head on collision of the classic and the contemporary in The Henchmen - a chaotic, co-operative crime thriller.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/header.jpg?t=1779785236", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779785236", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779785236", "website": "https